Description: enhanced USB radio channel driver for AllStarLink
 USBRadioPlus is an AllStarLink USB radio channel driver with configurable audio
 filtering and dynamics processing for amateur-radio and land-mobile interfaces
 using CM119-class USB audio devices.

Package: usbradioplus-tune
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, whiptail
Breaks: usbradioplus (<< ${binary:Version})
Replaces: usbradioplus (<< ${binary:Version})
Description: accessible radio and processing tuner for USBRadioPlus and standalone
 One keyboard-operated tuner provides configuration editing, calibration and
 live radio measurements through either the ASL3 channel or the standalone
 service's private local control socket. Installing it does not require
 Asterisk or install a radio controller.

